# What to check while the SCF runs. Nothing here prints: it goes into the
# story (viv story scf_demo.viv), and a failed hold fails the run.
scf  @7900cbbc
  watch per iteration  E, dE, dnorm
  hold                 dnorm >= 0.0                                  "a density change is a length, never negative"
  hold at fock         F == transpose(F) within 1e-15                "the Fock matrix is symmetric"
  hold at density      Dn[0, 0] + Dn[1, 1] + Dn[2, 2] == 2.0 within 1e-12  "the new density holds two electrons"
  watch at guess       D
  watch at check       worst
  trace                energy
